{"product_id":"4800mah-extended-use-power-bank","title":"4800 mAh Extended Use Power Bank","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe 4800mAh Extended Use Power Bank is designed for all-day shifts and assignments where a backup isn’t an option. Compatible with all M-Series products, it features the easy-to-use rail mounting design that supports Vuzix’ unique hot-swap capabilities, meaning you never need to interrupt your work when changing out the battery. With operating temperatures ranging from 0C\/32F to 45C\/114F, this battery is excellent for use in the freezer or on the line.\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43647324389542,"sku":"472T0A009","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/DSC_2026-Edit.jpg?v=1666652061","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/4800mah-extended-use-power-bank","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}